{"version":1,"content":"<p>日劇天王木村拓哉出道35年首辦亞洲巡迴演唱會，一連兩場的台灣站，昨日(14日)圓滿落幕，合共吸引近萬人朝聖。</p><p>在昨晚尾場上，他唱到歌曲《迎著新風》時，將歌詞的「東京」改成「台北」，副歌更將麥克風遞向台下，邀請全場大合唱，並讚歌迷唱得比前一日好</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T03:14:30.689606+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T01:32:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T03:07:55.787454+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T03:07:55.787454+00:00","content_hash":"a92ed5b2164dc783f443df4c2df0e32a0d875fb694f2ad165bb4d9186525e045","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}